    "html": "<p>A body performs simple harmonic motion. The table provides values for its acceleration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span> at corresponding displacements <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> from the equilibrium position.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Displacement <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> / m</th><th>Acceleration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span> / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{m s}^{-2}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.02\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-2.00\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.04\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-4.00\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.06\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-6.00\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the frequency of the oscillation?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5\\pi \\text{ Hz}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5}{\\pi} \\text{ Hz}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\\pi \\text{ Hz}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{10}{\\pi} \\text{ Hz}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
